+12: 
+13: - Spec source: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-08-tui-project-management-design.md`.
+14: - Do not add project deletion.
+15: - Do not add a direct command for the add-project page.
+16: - Use `/projects` as the TUI slash command for project list.
+17: - Use `ctrl+o` from project list to open add-project page.
+18: - Add-project search debounce is `10ms`.
+19: - In add-project page, `enter` confirms the input value, not the highlighted selector item.
+20: - In add-project page, `space` copies the highlighted selector item into the input and loads that directory's direct children.
